.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Get productive in OurGruuv quickly, then build
    %strong OG Mastery
    — continuous clarity and unfading growth for you, your reports, and the team — by
    %em doing
    the work over months, not by reading a manual.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"
  %p.mb-3
    Real Ability milestones are usually certified by a manager after they observe sustained demonstration of an ability.
    OG Academy uses a
    %strong practice Ability
    (OG Mastery) with checklist-style progress so you feel the
    %em ceremony
    of milestones while forming real habits in the product. These are
    %em not
    official company MAAP certifications.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 Three sections
  %ul.mb-3
    %li
      %strong Quick Start
      — act with yourself or your directs (check-in, observe, goal confidence). Names open One Thing.
    %li
      %strong OG Mastery milestones
      — collapsed cards; only your earliest unfinished milestone is open. Progress is computed from product activity.
    %li
      %strong Home base
      — when you're ready, pick a preferred start page (Start Here, My Growth, company goals/kudos, and more). You can always return via your profile menu.

  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 Example
  .border.rounded.p-3.bg-white.mb-3
    %p.mb-1.fw-semibold OG Mastery @ Milestone 1 Demonstrated
    %p.small.text-muted.mb-1 2/3 criteria
    %p.small.mb-0
      Checklist: logged in ✓ · clarity actions at zero ✓ · published OGO still open → go Observe from Quick Start.

  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 How to read milestone cards
  %ul.list-unstyled.mb-0
    %li.mb-1
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2{class: "bg-success", style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Complete criteria — green checks
    %li.mb-1
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2{class: "bg-secondary", style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Incomplete — open item with a short hint
    %li.mb-0
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2{class: "bg-primary", style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Open card — the milestone you're working toward now (others stay collapsed until then)
